{
  "info": {
    "name": "دفع المحركات — Mobile API v1",
    "description": "Mobile API — البادئة /api/v1\n\n**التشغيل السريع:**\n1. `Auth → Request OTP` (رقم العميل التجريبي 0512345678) — في وضع التطوير يرجع `debug_code` ويُحفظ تلقائياً في `otp_code`.\n2. `Auth → Verify OTP` — يحفظ `token` تلقائياً وتُرسل كل الطلبات بعده بـ Bearer.\n3. الضيف: أول `GET /cart` يرجع `token` ويُحفظ في `cart_token` ويرسل في الهيدر `X-Cart-Token`.\n\nالمتغيرات (`part_id`, `item_id`, `vehicle_id`, `address_id`, `number`...) تتعبأ تلقائياً من الاستجابات.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept', value: 'application/json' });",
          "const ct = pm.collectionVariables.get('cart_token');",
          "if (ct) pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Cart-Token', value: ct });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Accept-Language', value: pm.collectionVariables.get('locale') || 'ar' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "cart_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "locale",
      "value": "ar"
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "0512345678"
    },
    {
      "key": "otp_code",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "number",
      "value": "DM-261014-0472"
    },
    {
      "key": "part_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "item_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "make_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
